# Only these paths are ever COPYied into an image (builder/package.Containerfile and
# image/Containerfile); everything else — unpacked source trees, the rootfs staging
# dir, downloaded tarballs, .git — would just bloat the build context. Add an entry
# here when a Containerfile starts copying something new.
#
# Whole directories, because re-including a file under a directory that `*` has already
# excluded does not work: the parent has to come back first.
*
!builder
!image
# For one file: image/Containerfile COPYs test/known-missing-libs.txt, so that a variant's
# per-image dependency check and test/check-rootfs-deps.sh hold to the same allowlist.
# The directory as a whole, per the note above — re-including a file under an excluded
# directory does not work.
!test
